 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 508091,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Taleisha’s phone plan costs her $28.80 per month plus $0.20 per text message. How many text messages can she send/receive and keep her monthly phone bill no more than $50?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Break the words into components. \n</p><table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>The bill</td>\n<td>is no more than</td>\n<td>$28.80 flat fee</td>\n<td>plus</td>\n<td>$0.20 per message</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>B</i></td>\n<td>≥</td>\n<td>28.80</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>0.20<i>m</i></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Keep the bill to no more than $50.</p>\n<p>Keep <span data-math=\"28.80 + 0.2m \\le 50\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Solve the inequality <span data-math=\"28.80 + 0.2m \\le 50\"></span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"28.80 + 0.2m \\le {\\rm{ }}50 - 28.80\"></span></td>\n<td>Collect the constants on one side.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"0.2m \\le {\\rm{ }}21.2\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{0.2m}}{{0.2}} \\le {\\rm{ }}\\frac{{21.2}}{{0.2}}\"></span></td>\n<td>Divide both sides by 0.2.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"m \\le 106\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Taleisha can send no more than 106 text messages per month.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Taleisha can send/receive 106 or fewer text messages and keep her monthly bill no more than $50."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
